                                                "text": "\"Here's ten shillings for you, but I'm going to toe your backside first!\" said Manna. And the Dane let him kick away; his yellow teeth gleamed in a servile grin and then he clutched at the money."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36195823-78e2-44a4-abd0-01e582b9a5f2",
                                                "sense_id": "aa5e7128-80bc-31c7-899e-c9599d08c72f",
                                                "text": "Just five minutes later the turnaround was complete when Arshavin toed the ball through to Bendtner, who slotted into the left corner from close range just before half-time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c68ba235-05f7-3777-94bb-ce23955f3371",
                                        "entry_id": "32d8821c-b9da-32dd-a9cf-6cc30cce91e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To touch or reach with the toes; to come fully up to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac2ad9fa-621f-48d3-9356-3a7b9c01a255",
                                                "sense_id": "c68ba235-05f7-3777-94bb-ce23955f3371",
                                                "text": "to toe the mark"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85b62bd6-b2f2-368f-96dc-817c0943b55b",
                                        "entry_id": "32d8821c-b9da-32dd-a9cf-6cc30cce91e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To fasten (a piece) by driving a fastener at a near-45-degree angle through the side (of the piece) into the piece to which it is to be fastened."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a1c9a12-8c11-4c28-8ad8-66b5ef3c9c45",
                                                "sense_id": "85b62bd6-b2f2-368f-96dc-817c0943b55b",
                                                "text": "The framers toed the irregular pieces into the sill."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ff59ce6-ceb9-329d-ada8-24466e321188",
                                        "entry_id": "32d8821c-b9da-32dd-a9cf-6cc30cce91e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To mishit a golf ball with the toe of the club."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
